{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1486324-aether-what-if","id":1486324,"title":"[Aether] What If","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Onyx Path Announcements"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-12T23:00:10-07:00","id":1486324,"title":"[Aether] What If","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>moonwolf8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1451830-tc-aether?p=1486320#post1486320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There was a Savage World campaign setting called War of the Worlds: The Remains in which adventurers ran around trying to recover the remains of Martian technology. There was also Martian Red Weed which in this campaign was addictive and awakened psychic powers while triggering metamorphosis in addicts. There were also Martian survivors. Of course with the European powers broken by the invasion their overseas colonies all successfully revolted.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>i will have to check that out because I\u2019ve had a TC setting brewing for years based on a similar concept that I might use as a possible future off of Aether if the player characters divert the canon primary-timeline, where leftover Martian tech results in the creation of Psions in the Edwardian period.<br /> <br /> My plan was<br /> <br /> British Empire - Biokinetics (note that bulk of Latents by population are Indian, so actually maintaining control is questionable)<br /> USA - Electrokinetics<br /> Empire of Japan - Vitakinetics<br /> Ottoman Empire - Telepaths<br /> Switzerland, but primarily hiring out their mercenaries to the German Empire - Psychokinetics<br /> Spiritualist movement - Clairsentients<br /> Boxer-victorious China - Superiors<br /> Russian Empire - not a monopoly, but bulk of the world\u2019s Psiads manifest there after Tunguska, French allies helping research that may lead to shared Quantakinesis Chamber<br /> Leftist Underground - using stolen Einstein research to work on Teleporter Chamber","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T11:59:35-07:00","id":1487035,"title":"","content":"Sounds interesting! One idea to mix things up a bit, could be to place Biokinetics in Germany and have some weird, paranormal &quot;Lebensreformbewegung&quot; instead of something more obviously militaristic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T12:19:16-07:00","id":1487038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Waldi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1486324-aether-what-if?p=1487035#post1487035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sounds interesting! One idea to mix things up a bit, could be to place Biokinetics in Germany and have some weird, paranormal &amp;quot;Lebensreformbewegung&amp;quot; instead of something more obviously militaristic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting notion. I went with British Empire to combine two factors - Darwin\u2019s immediate pupils being the ones responsible for the Chamber and managing the Psi Order, and the yogic self mastery for the large Indian contingent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T13:49:35-07:00","id":1487055,"title":"","content":"Makes quite a lot of sense. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T14:18:20-07:00","id":1487057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Waldi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1486324-aether-what-if?p=1487035#post1487035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sounds interesting! One idea to mix things up a bit, could be to place Biokinetics in Germany and have some weird, paranormal &amp;quot;Lebensreformbewegung&amp;quot; instead of something more obviously militaristic.</div> </div> </div> </div>British and German Psi Schhols still can split up and you can have evil Nazi psions.. \ud83d\ude08","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T23:44:22-07:00","id":1487113,"title":"","content":"Uh...evil Nazi psions....just let me take a few notes for my next Adventure!-campaign. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Just as a fun fact: If you want some Proto-Nazi-Villains during the victorian era, some parts of the Lebensreform would be surprisingly well suited for that. While looking like friendly 19th-Century-Hippies, some of them harboured thoughts and ideas, that were more than a little close to all this Blut-und-Boden-ideology of the later nazis. Also, a lot of them where aryan supremacists, who dabbled in all kinds of right-wing-esoterics. And now imagine this wingnuts with actual &quot;paranormal&quot; powers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T00:51:15-07:00","id":1487120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Waldi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1486324-aether-what-if?p=1487113#post1487113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uh...evil Nazi psions....just let me take a few notes for my next Adventure!-campaign. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I already doing this - here you are. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> ( Well, Franz is Mesmerist, cause it's <b>Adventure!</b> era - but they are proto-Psions in the first place )<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478161-character-creation-for-tc-2e\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...tion-for-tc-2e</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T01:12:49-07:00","id":1487124,"title":"","content":"Ha, Awesome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I must admit - all this contemplating about potential Lebensreform-villains led me to the thought of just using <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/August_Engelhardt\" target=\"_blank\">August Engelhardt</a> as such, either in Aether or, this would fit a little bit better timewise, in Adventure. But then again, in this special case, it would be somewhat hard doing so without slipping into comedy. Engelhardts Coconut Cult is one of those cases, where reality is just to wacky to be taken seriously.<br /> Engelhardts Pamphlets are still available - but unfortunately (or - in his case - fortunately)<a href=\"https://www.lehmanns.de/shop/sachbuch-ratgeber/33771351-9783844830996-hoch-der-aequator-nieder-mit-den-polen-eine-sorgenfreie-zukunft-im-imperium-der-kokosnuss\" target=\"_blank\"> only in German</a>.<br /> A satirical novel by Christian Kracht, based on August Engelhardt, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.de/Imperium-Fiction-South-Seas-English-ebook/dp/B00R6AVNXU\" target=\"_blank\">however was translated into English.</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}